        Quest("CH1-049",1,49,"Lucia",category="Khorinis - Harbor District",giver="Bromor",location="Khorinis - Harbor District",prerequisites="Start Where Are the Missing People?; speak with Bromor in Khorinis harbor.",summary="Investigate the missing courtesan Lucia and trace her from the harbor brothel to Jharkendar.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("After starting Where Are the Missing People?, question Bromor at Khorinis's harbor brothel about the missing residents.","Ask Nadja about Lucia for additional clues; Bromor charges 50 gold for a private conversation with Nadja.","Search the bandit camp behind Sekob's farm and read Lucia's letter in a tent.","Tell Elvrich what you found, rescuing him from the bandits on the path to the Water Mages if needed.","Eventually find Lucia alive in the bandit camp in Jharkendar."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="Bromor is the source's starting NPC; Nadja is an optional informant and Elvrich a related contact. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/ljusija.67274/",searchTags=listOf("lucia","khorinis - harbor district","local quest giver in khorinis - harbor district")),
