        Quest("CH1-056",1,56,"The Sunken Ship",category="Khorinis - Harbor District",giver="Farim",location="Khorinis - Harbor District",prerequisites="Complete Farim's earlier fishing/food task; before Chapter 3.",summary="Farim tells you about a wreck off the coast near the old lighthouse.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Farim tells you about a wreck off the coast near the old lighthouse. Swim/div dive to the wreck and search it carefully for the quest sack/cargo. Bring what you recover back to Farim."),reward="250 gold and useful loot including a silver ring, red pepper and a piece of magic ore.",warnings="Save before a long dive if your stamina/air supply is low.",searchTags=listOf("the sunken ship","khorinis - harbor district","farim")),
        Quest("CH1-057",1,57,"Ore Shipment",category="Khorinis - Harbor District",giver = "Viper",location="Khorinis - Harbor District",prerequisites="Start through Viper in Chapter 1; access to the Valley of Mines and Xardas is required to finish in Chapter 2–4.",summary="Track Viper's hidden ore shipment through Snipes, Aleph and Xardas, then retrieve the stash.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Speak repeatedly with Viper at Kardif's tavern; agree to give him 100 pieces of ore from the missing shipment to activate the search.","Find Snipes at Lobart's farm and remind him of the old job. He says Aleph hid the ore near the Valley of Mines.","In Chapter 2, search the goblin cave close to Marcos's camp, inspect Aleph's remains and take his bone.","Report Aleph's death to Viper, then bring the bone to Xardas, who summons Aleph's ghost; defeat the hostile spirit after learning the hiding place.","Back in the Valley of Mines, locate the rock in the river near the entrance descent and swim through the underwater passage into a small grotto.","Defeat the skeleton guardian, dig up the ore package and collect its 300 pieces of ore.","Return with the ore to Snipes and Viper to finish the quest."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="Do not postpone until Chapter 5, when Xardas is no longer available. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/gruz-rudy.67166/",searchTags=listOf("ore shipment","khorinis - harbor district","local quest giver in khorinis - harbor district")),
