        Quest("CH1-059",1,59,"The Cursed Lighthouse",category="Khorinis - Harbor District",giver = "Jack",location="Khorinis - Harbor District",prerequisites="Talk to Jack before Chapter 5; later stages require Greg in Jharkendar and progress in Jack's Pipe.",summary="Investigate the offshore haunted lighthouse and discover why the ghost of Stefan cannot rest.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Ask Jack about the haunted lighthouse out at sea. Sail to its island and defeat the two bandits outside.","Enter the lighthouse, take its teleport ring, collect the silver ring on the stairs and press the hidden symbol near the top.","Ask Hanna about the inscribed ring and Xardas about the symbol and the curse.","Use Xardas's Summon Ghost scroll at the skeleton on top of the lighthouse and speak to Stefan's ghost below.","Ask Kardif and Jack about the pirate known as Kelevra. Once Greg is in Jharkendar, discuss Jack's pipe with Greg to learn Kelevra is Jack.","Talk Jack into visiting the offshore lighthouse on the following day, then speak to Stefan.","With at least 40 rhetoric, persuade Stefan not to kill Jack before lighting the beacon, or accept one of the harsher outcomes.","Finish the lighthouse confrontation and report to Jack where possible."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="A peaceful outcome protecting Jack requires 40 rhetoric. Igniting the light without Stefan's promise may result in Jack's death. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/prokljatyj-majak.66900/",searchTags=listOf("the cursed lighthouse","khorinis - harbor district","local quest giver in khorinis - harbor district")),
