        Quest("CH1-061",1,61,"Accidental Courier",category="Khorinis - Harbor District",giver = "Nagur",location="Khorinis - Harbor District",prerequisites="Ask Kardif about work and pay him for the special-job lead to Nagur.",summary="Choose whether to deliver Baltram's parcel to Nagur for the Thieves' Guild or report him to Lord Andre.",walkthroughSteps=listOf("Pay Kardif for information about special work, then meet Nagur at his harbor tavern.","Negotiate a 50/50 division with Nagur; he orders you to pose as Baltram's courier.","Speak with Baltram in the marketplace and take the assignment to pick up goods from Akil's farm.","If preserving the Thieves' Guild route, collect the parcel from Akil and deliver it to Nagur instead of Baltram.","Wait one day and return to Nagur for your share.","Alternatively, report Nagur to Lord Andre immediately after receiving his proposal; this damages your relationship with the Thieves' Guild."),reward="Reward varies by quest/build; exact values should be taken from the current in-game dialogue or source page.",warnings="Reporting Nagur to Lord Andre is an exclusive alternative to delivering the parcel for him. Source: https://rpgrussia.com/threads/kurer-po-oshibke.66773/",searchTags=listOf("accidental courier","khorinis - harbor district","local quest giver in khorinis - harbor district")),
